{"id":"da3159c0c219916e","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-woodin.md","title":"Woodin Cardinal","display":"df-woodin — Woodin Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-woodin","aliases":["58-df-woodin","Woodin Cardinal"],"display":"df-woodin — Woodin Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-woodin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-woodin</span><span>Woodin Cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-woodin — Woodin Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" href=\"?note=f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\\in V\">\\(\\delta\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (parameter-sensitive strongness witness, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" href=\"?note=f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Woodin}\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Woodin}\\subseteq V\\)</span> (Woodin-cardinal predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件使用类量词元语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S\\)</span> 是依赖文件中已展开的元语言兼容名，下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 不把类嵌入变为集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}woodin}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\n\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\delta)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S(\\delta,A,\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}woodin}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\n\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\delta)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S(\\delta,A,\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The witness atom carries the required class-level embedding scheme. The set-coded elementary-embedding predicate is not applied to the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>For every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq V_\\delta\">\\(A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\)</span>, some <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa&lt;\\delta\">\\(\\kappa&lt;\\delta\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\delta\">\\(&lt;\\delta\\)</span>-strong for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>They play a crucial role in inner model theory and determinacy research</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md","status":"resolved","id":"f9019f8b9c0a2aa1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V$ (cardinal predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md","status":"resolved","id":"f9019f8b9c0a2aa1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (parameter-sensitive strongness witness, see [[../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\delta\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Woodin}\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{meta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}woodin}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\n\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\delta)\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S(\\delta,A,\\kappa).","display":true},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq V_\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa<\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"<\\delta","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false}],"bytes":1616,"backlinks":[{"id":"baa9f2ada6bcef62","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"22ec8272f07ee0fb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b8869305e2d6e82f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"67790f1308175de1","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\delta$ (Woodin-cardinal candidate, see [[58-df-woodin]])"},{"id":"fae6bcb694dc1aa7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)$ (Woodin-cardinal predicate, see [[../batch08/58-df-woodin.md]])"},{"id":"8aa591103dfc304a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Woodin}\\subseteq V$ (see [[../batch08/58-df-woodin.md]])."},{"id":"10b43f4fd4ac0d83","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Det}(T,A,M)$ is the exact three-argument determinacy predicate from [[58-df-determinacy]] and $\\mathrm{Woodin}$ is the Woodin-cardinal predicate from [[58-df-woodin]]."},{"id":"3a2e311d286ab9b6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\delta$ (Woodin基数, see [[58-df-woodin]])"},{"id":"0624e99112a7488f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Woodin}$ (Woodin-cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-woodin]])"},{"id":"2fe6d911cae6289e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on